    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speak it out, and 'I' will assist you in finding redemption.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Confessional is an innovative game that integrates public - welfare practice, spiritual outpouring, and plot exploration, pursuing inner salvation in a virtual world. The hustle and bustle and pressure of modern society have dusted people\u2019s hearts. Players step into the \u201cCyber Confessional\u201d and can embark on a unique journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cyber Confessional is now available!!!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-World Charity Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>81 real-world charity tasks</strong> to gradually resolve past regrets through acts of kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find redemption in encouragement and heartfelt praise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treehole Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A judgment-free zone for unfiltered self-expression\u2014your secrets stay safely encrypted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easter Egg Storylines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden storylines influenced by your choices, packed with surprises and emotional depth.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speak it out, and 'I' will assist you in finding redemption.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Confessional is an innovative game that integrates public - welfare practice, spiritual outpouring, and plot exploration, pursuing inner salvation in a virtual world. The hustle and bustle and pressure of modern society have dusted people\u2019s hearts. Players step into the \u201cCyber Confessional\u201d and can embark on a unique journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cyber Confessional is now available!!!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-World Charity Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>81 real-world charity tasks</strong> to gradually resolve past regrets through acts of kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find redemption in encouragement and heartfelt praise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treehole Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A judgment-free zone for unfiltered self-expression\u2014your secrets stay safely encrypted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easter Egg Storylines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden storylines influenced by your choices, packed with surprises and emotional depth.</p>",
    "short_description": "When you confide in your heart, 'I' will accompany you on the journey of redemption. Cyber Confession Room &quot;is an interactive visual novel game where you can choose a tree hole to listen to your confession. You can also practice public welfare tasks to obtain redemption",
